		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sleep before</i> or <i>first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				104
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sleep for</i> or <i>on behalf of</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεγρηγορότας καὶ προκαθεύδοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					8.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
